{"id":"affronter","lemma":"affronter","pos":"verb","rank":1766,"glosses":["to confront, face","to face off, to clash"],"ipa":"/a.fʁɔ̃.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b0/Fr-affronter.ogg/Fr-affronter.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"affronte","2s":"affrontes","3s":"affronte","1p":"affrontons","2p":"affrontez","3p":"affrontent"},"imperfect":{"1s":"affrontais","2s":"affrontais","3s":"affrontait","1p":"affrontions","2p":"affrontiez","3p":"affrontaient"},"preterite":{"1s":"affrontai","2s":"affrontas","3s":"affronta","1p":"affrontâmes","2p":"affrontâtes","3p":"affrontèrent"},"future":{"1s":"affronterai","2s":"affronteras","3s":"affrontera","1p":"affronterons","2p":"affronterez","3p":"affronteront"},"conditional":{"1s":"affronterais","2s":"affronterais","3s":"affronterait","1p":"affronterions","2p":"affronteriez","3p":"affronteraient"},"perfect":{"1s":"ai affronté","2s":"as affronté","3s":"a affronté","1p":"avons affronté","2p":"avez affronté","3p":"ont affronté"}},"subjunctive":{"present":{"1s":"affronte","2s":"affrontes","3s":"affronte","1p":"affrontions","2p":"affrontiez","3p":"affrontent"},"imperfect":{"1s":"affrontasse","2s":"affrontasses","3s":"affrontât","1p":"affrontassions","2p":"affrontassiez","3p":"affrontassent"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"affronte","1p":"affrontons","2p":"affrontez"}}},"nonFinite":{"gerund":"affrontant","participle":"affronté"},"formAudio":{"affronté":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-affront%C3%A9.wav","affronte":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-affronte.wav","affrontes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d9/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-affrontes.wav","affrontent":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c6/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-affrontent.wav","affrontera":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/13/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-affrontera.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il était prêt à affronter son destin.","en":"He was ready to face his fate.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"ready"},{"g":"to / at"},null,{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"destiny, fate"}]},{"text":"Je ne veux pas affronter cela tout seule.","en":"I don't want to face that alone.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"alone","l":"seul"}]},{"text":"Elle était prête à affronter son destin.","en":"She was ready to face her fate.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"ready","l":"prêt"},{"g":"to / at"},null,{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"destiny, fate"}]},{"text":"Je voulais que tu comprennes ce que tu affrontes.","en":"I wanted you to understand what you're up against.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to understand","l":"comprendre"},null,null,{"g":"you"},null],"phrases":[[5,7,"what"]]},{"text":"Je pense qu'il est temps pour moi d'affronter ce problème.","en":"I think it's time for me to confront that problem.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"problem"}]}]}